    "created_at": "2022-12-01T11:50:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-01T11:50:21Z",
    "body": "> The DOM one is only meant for use by DOM (which is why it's not exported); the HTML one is the one other specs should use.\r\n\r\nThis may be the intent, but the specs are marked up exactly the other way (hence my assumption behind the PR):\r\n* the DOM specs uses `data-export` on the [reflect `<dfn>`](https://github.com/whatwg/dom/blob/1aa6fb0c4bdb857b7fac10950d70c08a75ea07ad/dom.bs#L6453) (although that seems to have been done as part of [batch export of all definitions](https://github.com/whatwg/dom/pull/29))\r\n* the HTML spec doesn't have `export` set on its reflect `<dfn>`",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
